# OpenCode: un-ignore the directory itself so the inner
# .opencode/.gitignore can apply its own allowlist. The shared
# config (opencode.json) and the override example
# (opencode.local.example.json) are tracked; everything else
# under .opencode/ stays machine-local and is regenerated by
# scripts/sync_opencode_agents.py.
!.opencode/
